        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-18T12:57:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"kitmehsu\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/kitmehsu/48/1901_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> kitmehsu:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>MigrantP wrote:</b><br>\n<blockquote>This makes me think that Malpractice won't be a dedicated healer after all =)\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<p>I imagine he’s just gonna kinda phone in the healing, no dedication at all.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>DOCTOR MEDICO</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-i\"> Malpractice</span><br>\n<span class=\"bbcode-b\"> Power:</span> 1 target regains 2 HP, then Doctor Medico deals that target 2 psychic damage. Doctor Medico’s player spends the remainder of this round in court.</p>",
