      {
        "id": 23940,
        "name": "seesome",
        "username": "seesome",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/{size}/2018_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-18T15:56:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>To be fair, while dedicated healers are a common character class/type in RPGs and videogames, they're really rare in comic books.&nbsp; There are lots of comic book heroes with personal healing/regenerative powers and a bunch of who can heal others as a minor secondary secondary power, but almost no main characters whose primary power is that of healing others.&nbsp; So to me, the lack of a Healer felt right in a game that's simulating a comic book world.</p>",
        "post_number": 30,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:57:55.482Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
