        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-19T09:26:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I always thought there are no healers so that the games end quicker. When you can just heal all the damage the enemy does but don't do enough damage yourself then the game runs long and loses excitement.&nbsp;</p>",
