        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/belle_sorciere/{size}/1982_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-19T23:23:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's cool to have healing, and even a character that qualifies as an at least somewhat dedicated healer, but I am glad the game is not designed around needing healing.</p>",
